{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KPdZT64k1xPsA8pajpEddu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Test cases for `picoquictest/code_version_test.c`.\n2\t\n3\t#![allow(non_snake_case)]\n4\t\n5\t/// C: `code_version_test` in `picoquictest/code_version_test.c`.\n6\t///\n7\t/// The C body cross-checks `PICOQUIC_VERSION` against the version\n8\t/// recorded in `CMakeLists.txt`'s `project(picoquic VERSION ...)`\n9\t/// line.  In Rust the equivalent invariant is that\n10\t/// [`crate::VERSION`] is a well-formed four-part dotted version\n11\t/// string (`major.minor.patch.build`).\n12\t#[test]\n13\tfn code_version() {\n14\t    let parts: Vec<&str> = crate::VERSION.split('.').collect();\n15\t    assert_eq!(\n16\t        parts.len(),\n17\t        4,\n18\t        \"VERSION must be `major.minor.patch.build`, got {:?}\",\n19\t        crate::VERSION,\n20\t    );\n21\t    for (i, part) in parts.iter().enumerate() {\n22\t        part.parse::<u32>().unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n23\t            panic!(\"VERSION component {i} ({part:?}) is not a numeric u32: {e}\")\n24\t        });\n25\t    }\n26\t}\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"32591064-9639-4381-9e05-bc6e424efeca","uuid":"06c53e10-30e4-4c8c-8b89-7b73c5a1e8a5","timestamp":"2026-05-04T22:38:28.227Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/tests/code_version.rs","content":"//! Test cases for `picoquictest/code_version_test.c`.\n\n#![allow(non_snake_case)]\n\n/// C: `code_version_test` in `picoquictest/code_version_test.c`.\n///\n/// The C body cross-checks `PICOQUIC_VERSION` against the version\n/// recorded in `CMakeLists.txt`'s `project(picoquic VERSION ...)`\n/// line.  In Rust the equivalent invariant is that\n/// [`crate::VERSION`] is a well-formed four-part dotted version\n/// string (`major.minor.patch.build`).\n#[test]\nfn code_version() {\n    let parts: Vec<&str> = crate::VERSION.split('.').collect();\n    assert_eq!(\n        parts.len(),\n        4,\n        \"VERSION must be `major.minor.patch.build`, got {:?}\",\n        crate::VERSION,\n    );\n    for (i, part) in parts.iter().enumerate() {\n        part.parse::<u32>().unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n            panic!(\"VERSION component {i} ({part:?}) is not a numeric u32: {e}\")\n        });\n    }\n}\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}}}
